        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"claude-sonnet-4-20250514\",\n  \"max_tokens\": 1024,\n  \"system\": \"You are a deal intake parser for 108 Performance, a baseball/softball training academy in Knoxville, TN.\\n\\n## Step 1: Intent Classification\\nFirst, determine if this voice transcript describes a DEAL (athlete wants to sign up for a package) or SOMETHING ELSE (general note, question, reminder, update about existing athlete).\\n\\nIf NOT a deal, return:\\n{ \\\"is_deal\\\": false, \\\"summary\\\": \\\"<brief summary of what was said>\\\" }\\n\\nIf it IS a deal, proceed to Step 2.\\n\\n## Step 2: Extract Deal Fields\\n\\n### Package Matching (fuzzy to canonical)\\n\\n| Package | Code | Monthly | Annual | One-Time |\\n|---------|------|---------|--------|----------|\\n| 108 Experience | 108_experience | — | — | $2,000-$4,000 |\\n| Tri Star | tri_star | $499 | $5,500 | — |\\n| Virtual Experience | virtual | $550 | $6,000 | — |\\n| Virtual Pro | virtual_pro | $1,000 | $10,000 | — |\\n| College Prep | college_prep | $1,250 | $13,500 | — |\\n| Draft Prep | draft_prep | $1,500 | $15,000 | — |\\n| Pro Experience | pro_experience | custom | custom | — |\\n| Tour Experience | tour_experience | — | — | $500/athlete |\\n| Coaches Experience | coaches_experience | — | — | $500/day |\\n| Coaches Mentorship | coaches_mentorship | $500 | — | — |\\n| Powered by 108 | powered_by_108 | — | $20,000 yr1 / $10,000 yr2+ | — |\\n| Performance Institute | performance_institute | — | $14,500-$25,000/yr | — |\\n\\n### Fuzzy matching examples:\\n- \\\"wants to train here\\\" / \\\"local\\\" / \\\"unlimited\\\" → tri_star\\n- \\\"remote\\\" / \\\"virtual\\\" / \\\"from home\\\" → virtual (or virtual_pro if \\\"pro\\\"/\\\"quarterly\\\" mentioned)\\n- \\\"college recruiting\\\" / \\\"get seen\\\" → college_prep\\n- \\\"draft\\\" / \\\"scouts\\\" / \\\"get drafted\\\" → draft_prep\\n- \\\"pro\\\" / \\\"minor league\\\" / \\\"MLB\\\" → pro_experience\\n- \\\"fly in\\\" / \\\"come check us out\\\" / \\\"3 days\\\" → 108_experience\\n- \\\"coach wants to visit\\\" / \\\"shadow\\\" → coaches_experience\\n- \\\"tour\\\" / \\\"camp\\\" → tour_experience\\n\\n### 108 Experience pricing:\\n- Single skill: 2d=$2,000 | 3d=$2,500 | 4d=$3,000 | 5d=$3,500\\n- Two skills: 2d=$2,500 | 3d=$3,000 | 4d=$3,500 | 5d=$4,000\\n- Default if not specified: 3 days, single skill, $2,500\\n\\n### Output JSON:\\n{\\n  \\\"is_deal\\\": true,\\n  \\\"athlete_name\\\": \\\"string (REQUIRED)\\\",\\n  \\\"athlete_phone\\\": \\\"string | null (+1XXXXXXXXXX format)\\\",\\n  \\\"athlete_email\\\": \\\"string | null\\\",\\n  \\\"athlete_level\\\": \\\"pro | college | high_school | middle_school | youth | null\\\",\\n  \\\"athlete_age\\\": \\\"number | null\\\",\\n  \\\"sport\\\": \\\"baseball | softball | both\\\",\\n  \\\"skill_focus\\\": \\\"hitting | pitching | two_way | null\\\",\\n  \\\"package\\\": \\\"string (one of the codes above)\\\",\\n  \\\"billing_frequency\\\": \\\"monthly | annual | one_time | custom\\\",\\n  \\\"price_cents\\\": \\\"integer (in cents)\\\",\\n  \\\"duration_days\\\": \\\"number | null\\\",\\n  \\\"preferred_start\\\": \\\"string | null\\\",\\n  \\\"preferred_schedule\\\": \\\"string | null\\\",\\n  \\\"is_minor\\\": \\\"boolean | null\\\",\\n  \\\"parent_contact\\\": \\\"string | null\\\",\\n  \\\"notes\\\": \\\"string | null\\\",\\n  \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"float 0-1\\\",\\n  \\\"field_confidence\\\": { \\\"athlete_name\\\": \\\"float\\\", \\\"package\\\": \\\"float\\\", \\\"price_cents\\\": \\\"float\\\" },\\n  \\\"alternatives\\\": \\\"string | null\\\"\\n}\\n\\n### Confidence rules:\\n- If athlete_name cannot be determined → confidence = 0\\n- If package is ambiguous → confidence = max 0.6, note alternatives\\n- If price quoted differently than default → use quoted price, note in notes\\n\\nReturn ONLY the JSON object, no markdown formatting.\",\n  \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"{{ $json.transcript }}\"}]\n}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "uuid-28",
      "name": "Process Claude Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [3000, 1300],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const response = $input.first().json;\nconst routeData = $('Route Message').first().json;\nlet content = '';\nif (response.content && Array.isArray(response.content)) {\n  content = response.content.map(c => c.text || '').join('');\n} else if (typeof response.content === 'string') {\n  content = response.content;\n} else if (response.body?.content) {\n  content = Array.isArray(response.body.content) ? response.body.content.map(c => c.text || '').join('') : response.body.content;\n}\n\nlet deal;\ntry {\n  const jsonMatch = content.match(/```(?:json)?\\s*([\\s\\S]*?)```/) || [null, content];\n  deal = JSON.parse(jsonMatch[1].trim());\n} catch (e) {\n  deal = { is_deal: false, summary: 'Failed to parse AI response', error: e.message };\n}\n\nconst transcript = $json.transcript || routeData.messageBody || '';\n\nif (!deal.is_deal) {\n  return [{ json: { ...routeData, transcript, deal, parseRoute: 'not_a_deal' } }];\n}\nif (deal.confidence < 0.4) {\n  return [{ json: { ...routeData, transcript, deal, parseRoute: 'low_confidence' } }];\n}\nif (!deal.athlete_name) {\n  return [{ json: { ...routeData, transcript, deal, parseRoute: 'missing_name' } }];\n}\nreturn [{ json: { ...routeData, transcript, deal, parseRoute: 'valid_deal' } }];"
      }
    },
